 * `policy`. The normalizer expands the string into
 * `{ aggregatorUrl: <string> }` before any downstream code sees it.
 *
 * @example
 * ```ts
 * experimental: {
 *   registry: "https://registry.emdashcms.com",
 * }
 * ```
 *
 * Equivalent to:
 * ```ts
 * experimental: {
 *   registry: { aggregatorUrl: "https://registry.emdashcms.com" },
 * }
 * ```
 */
